# Production build values (public: `VITE_*` goes into the browser bundle).
# App: https://curupira.maiyu.com.br - API: https://api-curupira.maiyu.com.br
VITE_API_URL=https://api-curupira.maiyu.com.br
VITE_SITE_URL=https://curupira.maiyu.com.br
VITE_DATA_SOURCE=api

# Storage origin
# The browser PUTs each report photo straight to the bucket through a presigned URL, and
# the production CSP (`vite.config.ts`) only lets `connect-src`/`img-src` reach origins
# listed here. Without it every photo upload is blocked in production. It is the origin
# of `STORAGE_ENDPOINT` in the backend (no path, no trailing slash); with the bucket in
# path style it is the endpoint itself, with virtual-host style it is
# `https://<bucket>.<endpoint host>`.
# The production bucket address is not defined yet. Set it BEFORE the first production
# build; no value is guessed here on purpose.
# VITE_STORAGE_URL=
